{"seq":35,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2651"},"reason":"'The first system to cover the whole globe was Omega' overlooked the US Navy's Transit satellite system, which gave worldwide radio fixes from 1964; Omega (about 1971) was the first worldwide ground-based system. Body now says 'ground-based' and the notes name Transit, in all three languages.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transit_(satellite)"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omega_(navigation_system)"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",282],["+","ground-based "],["=",519]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",250],["+","bodengestützte "],["=",491]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",242],["+","наземной "],["=",511]]},{"field":"notesEn","old":"","new":"Omega was the first worldwide system of ground stations; the US Navy's Transit satellites had already given worldwide position fixes from 1964."},{"field":"notesDe","old":"","new":"Omega war das erste weltweite System aus Bodenstationen; die Transit-Satelliten der US-Marine lieferten schon ab 1964 weltweit Standortbestimmungen."},{"field":"notesRu","old":"","new":"«Омега» была первой всемирной системой наземных станций; спутники Transit ВМС США давали определение места по всему миру уже с 1964 года."}],"hash":"7bfb2dfdabe3","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"f88797c9dc20764f2a9c9b8cf008349230878cda44959787c7ef7076e20573ca"},
{"seq":36,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"marked","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f14353"},"reason":"Spans re-placed on the reworded sentence ('first ground-based system').","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omega_(navigation_system)"}],"changes":[{"field":"spans","old":{"en":[836,5],"de":[883,5],"ru":[874,5]},"new":{"en":[849,5],"de":[898,5],"ru":[883,5]}}],"hash":"aa102345b636","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"15968c2f6792d3e9f1f79be17463590e8a74f655d16d73d94ebee79d1f5cfc6a"},
{"seq":37,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w14658"},"reason":"The printed card asked for the 'first global radio navigation system'; Transit satellites were global from 1964, so the question now asks for the first global ground-based system. The card's words are kept in cardText.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transit_(satellite)"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"What is the name of the first global radio navigation system, which shares its name with a Swiss luxury watchmaker?","new":"What is the name of the first global ground-based radio navigation system, which shares its name with a Swiss luxury watchmaker?"},{"field":"de","old":"Welchen Namen hat das erste globale Radio-Navigationssystem, das seinen Namen mit einem Schweizer Luxusuhrenhersteller teilt?","new":"Welchen Namen hat das erste globale bodengestützte Funknavigationssystem, das seinen Namen mit einem Schweizer Luxusuhrenhersteller teilt?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Как называется первая глобальная система радионавигации, название которой совпадает с именем швейцарского производителя элитных часов?","new":"Как называется первая глобальная наземная система радионавигации, название которой совпадает с именем швейцарского производителя элитных часов?"},{"field":"cardText","new":"Welchen Namen hat das erste globale Radio-Navigationssystem, das seinen Namen mit einem Schweizer Luxusuhrenhersteller teilt?"}],"hash":"eeda31fb4624","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"0aa19c93509336b0dff9da16add2f2b80a1016632f3d9148ee2fa3fb77674ea0"},
